Package: hovercraft
Title: Tooltips for 'Shiny' and 'bslib' Pages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
      person("Harsh", "Verma", email = "125121920+insightsurge@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
      person("TODO(founder)", role = c("ctb", "cph"), comment = "Copyright holder of the bundled tip engine")
    )
Description: Puts a tip on any 'HTML' tag in a 'Shiny' app or a 'bslib' page. The tip shows when the pointer rests on the tag or keyboard focus arrives, and holds plain text or a named template filled in from the values of one item, such as a row of a table. Tips follow the page's light and dark mode and can be themed, with a contrast check. They are drawn by a small 'JavaScript' file that ships with the package.
